# The stock HelloWorld prints its greeting and counts seconds on the second line.
open
step 1500ms
expect @lcd.backlight lit
expect @lcd.text line 0 "hello, world!"
expect @lcd.text line 1 "1"
step 1000ms
expect @lcd.text line 1 "2"
# The Nano starts the sketch about 66 ms after power-on, the start its fuses set, so the
# LiquidCrystal constructor's first writes land after the LCD's 15 ms power-on wait.
expect no diagnostics
